# Desktop auxiliary features

Band A/B/C template for desktop shells (native, Electron/Tauri, tray hybrids).
Copy to `.devcentr/checklists/auxiliary-desktop.cmk`.
Progress: `auxiliary-desktop.cmk.checks/state.json5` (do not rewrite markers here for checkoff).

Mark N/A in the sidecar with marker `-` and a note.
Stable ids: trailing `{id="…"}`.

## Band A — 1.0 blockers

::: checklist [type="progress" id="desktop-a"]
[ ] Help menu / Help page (docs + report issue) {id="desktop.a.help"}
[ ] About: version + build id + channel {id="desktop.a.about"}
[ ] Check for updates (+ policy disable) {id="desktop.a.check-updates"}
[ ] Safe apply (stage / quit / replace / relaunch) {id="desktop.a.safe-apply"}
[ ] Debug dump (redacted) {id="desktop.a.debug-dump"}
[ ] Open logs / config folders {id="desktop.a.open-logs"}
[ ] Preferences with reset {id="desktop.a.preferences"}
[ ] Crash breadcrumb {id="desktop.a.crash-breadcrumb"}
[ ] Signed installer + uninstall {id="desktop.a.installer"}
:::

## Band B — support and retention

::: checklist [type="progress" id="desktop-b"]
[ ] What's new after update {id="desktop.b.whats-new"}
[ ] First-run / onboarding {id="desktop.b.first-run"}
[ ] Single-instance (or documented multi) {id="desktop.b.single-instance"}
[ ] Protocol/file handlers cleaned on uninstall {id="desktop.b.handlers"}
[ ] Tray/menu bar quit + status (if used) {id="desktop.b.tray"}
[ ] Autostart opt-in (if used) {id="desktop.b.autostart"}
[ ] Offline/connectivity UI {id="desktop.b.connectivity"}
[ ] Keyboard shortcuts reference {id="desktop.b.shortcuts"}
[ ] Accessibility baseline {id="desktop.b.a11y"}
:::

## Band C — fleets and scale

::: checklist [type="progress" id="desktop-c"]
[ ] Opt-in telemetry {id="desktop.c.telemetry"}
[ ] Enterprise pin/disable updates {id="desktop.c.enterprise-pin"}
[ ] Proxy / custom CA doctor notes {id="desktop.c.proxy-ca"}
[ ] Localization {id="desktop.c.l10n"}
[ ] Repair / clear-cache {id="desktop.c.repair"}
:::
